# Allowlist: the image builds (deploy/docker/) need only the Rust workspace,
# the web console sources and the relay key guard. Everything else stays out
# of the build context, above all target/ (hundreds of GB) and web/node_modules.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!LICENSE
!.cargo/
!crates/
!xtask/
!web/
!deploy/docker/relay-key-guard.rs
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/coverage/
web/e2e-results/
web/e2e/.auth/
web/.tanstack/
# Local secrets and state that may sit inside the allowed trees.
**/.env*
**/*.db*
**/*.sqlite3*
**/master.key
**/id_ed25519*
